/**
 * The `ry` [CSS](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/CSS) property defines the y-axis, or
 * vertical, radius of an SVG `ellipse` and the vertical curve of the corners of an SVG `rect`
 * rectangle. If present, it overrides the shape's `ry` attribute.
 *
 * Initial: auto. Inherited: no.
 * Percentages: refer to the height of the current SVG viewport.
 *
 * Keyword effects:
 * - auto: When set or defaulting to `auto`, the `ry` value equals the absolute length value used
 * for `rx`. If both `ry` and `rx` have a computed value of `auto`, the used value is `0`.
 *
 * Grammar: <length-percentage> | auto
